atical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Getting Directions to an Interview"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When you give or get directions to an interview, there is a lot of information to give or listen for. You use nouns to express this information."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Thomas</span>: Let's say 10 a.m. tomorrow.</br> <span class=\"strong\">James: </span> Where is the office?</br> <span class=\"strong\">Mr. Thomas</span>: It's at 135 Main Street. Come to the 7th floor. It's suite 715.</br>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Information\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" What to listen for\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"interview time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" 10 a.m. tomorrow\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the address\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" at 135 Main Street\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"floor\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the 7th floor\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"office or suite\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" suite 715\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" extra information\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" come 20 minutes early\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Street and Suite Numbers - Nouns Relating to a Place or Building"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Street and suite or floor numbers are not said like regular numbers."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" What they say\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" What they mean\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" 1 - 35 Main Street</br> suite 7 - 15</br> 10 - 27 Carlton</br> we're in 15- 50</br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"135 Main Street</br> suite 715</br> 1027 Carlton Street</br> we're in office 1550</br>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "suite "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a group of rooms or offices"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">(noun)</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our suite is on the 7th floor."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you talk about where to go for an interview."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pre-interview"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "before an interview"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">(adjective)</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Please fill out this pre-interview form."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to expect"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to think something is likely"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">(verb)</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can expect me to be there at 9 a.m. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I can't wait! "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "excited about an event"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can't wait to go for the interview."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "See you then."}, {"type": "definition", "content": "expecting to see you at the arranged time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">(expression)</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am coming at 9 a.m. See you then."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le06ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Fill in the chart with information for an interview."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Sit back to back with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice saying your information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You give information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Your partner writes it down."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Check if the information is correct."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Change roles, make up new information, and try again."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":6,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Information\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Interview time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The address \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The floor\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The office or suite\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Extra information\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">What tolisten for</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I give meeting information over the phone."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I listen to and note down information for a meeting."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use words from the lesson in a real situation."}]}], "type": "sena"}